   {
    "text": "Ice is hard and cold. But it is also very **slippery**. Why can you **slide** on ice?",
    "ko": "얼음은 단단하고 차가워요. 하지만 아주 미끄럽기도 해요. 왜 얼음 위에서는 미끄러질까요?"
   },
   {
    "text": "The top of the **ice** has a very thin **layer** of water. It works like oil and lets things slide.",
